<section id="policy" class="nf-section-skytint">
	<div class="nf-container left-content">
		<h1 class="nf-section-title">Website Terms and Conditions of Use</h1>

		<h3>Application of the Website Terms and Conditions of Use</h3>
		<p>Welcome to www.newsfilecorp.com (the <strong>"Website"</strong>) operated by Newsfile Corp. (<strong>"TMX Newsfile"</strong>. <strong>"we"</strong>, <strong>"us"</strong> or <strong>"our"</strong>). The Website provides data and other information including, without limitation, articles, news releases, publications, videos, products, graphics, sound, images, icons, software, applications, interactive features, tools, pictures, trade-marks, trade names, logos, design, layout and other materials or content (referred to collectively as <strong>"Web Content"</strong>) in relation to news dissemination and regulatory filing via the EDGAR, SEDAR+, and SEDI systems and other services offered by TMX Newsfile (collectively <strong>"Services"</strong>). The person accessing or using the Website, Web Content or the Services is referred to as <strong>"you"</strong> or <strong>"your"</strong>.</p>
		<p>The Website, the Web Content and the Services are provided to you subject to your agreement to be bound by these terms and conditions of use (<strong>"Website Terms and Conditions of Use"</strong>). BY ACCESSING OR USING THE WEBSITE, THE WEB CONTENT OR THE SERVICES, YOU ARE AGREEING TO COMPLY WITH AND BE LEGALLY BOUND BY THESE WEBSITE TERMS AND CONDITIONS OF USE. IF YOU DO NOT AGREE WITH ONE OR MORE OF THE PROVISIONS CONTAINED HEREIN, DO NOT ACCESS OR USE THE WEBSITE, THE WEB CONTENT OR THE SERVICES.</p>
		<p>The Website is open to visitors. However, to access certain areas of the Website, we require you to create an account with us. Creating an account allows you to access other Services not available to visitors.</p>
		<p>As used herein, the phrase "Service Providers" includes, but is not limited to, any licensors, suppliers, information providers or other third parties that provide, from time to time, any data, information, content, application, tool, feature or service for purposes of the Website.</p>

		<h3>Rights Granted and Restrictions on Use</h3>
		<p>TMX Newsfile grants to you a limited non-exclusive, non-transferable license to view and print the material on the Website for your non-commercial or personal use only. All copies that you make must retain all copyright and other notices that are on the Website. Except as expressly provided in this paragraph, you may not use, distribute, sell, modify, transmit, revise, reverse engineer, republish, post or create derivative works (where applicable) of the Website or Web Content without TMX Newsfile’s prior written consent. You acknowledge and agree that the Website and the Web Content are the property of TMX Newsfile, its Service Providers and its customers (as applicable), and you will not acquire any rights or licenses in any trade-marks, patents, copyright or other intellectual property rights in the Website or the Web Content. The Website and the Web Content are protected by copyright, both individually and as a collective work or compilation and by trade-mark law, patent law and any other applicable laws.</p>

		<h3>Your Authority to Use the Website</h3>
		<p>By using the Website, you are representing to us that you have the power and authority to accept these Website Terms and Conditions of Use and to enter into this agreement with us, that you are capable of assuming, and do assume, any risks related to the use of the Website and the Web Content, and that you understand and accept these Website Terms and Conditions of Use and risks relating to their use. If you are dissatisfied with the Website or the Web Content, your sole and exclusive remedy is to stop using the Website and Web Content.</p>

		<h3>Electronic Communications</h3>
		<p>By accessing this Website or sending electronic mail to TMX Newsfile you are communicating with TMX Newsfile electronically. By doing so, you agree to receive communications from TMX Newsfile electronically. TMX Newsfile will communicate with you by electronic mail at the electronic mail address provided by you or by posting notices on this Website or any other website that may be generally designated in advance for such purpose. You consent to receiving electronically all agreements, notices, disclosures and other communications that TMX Newsfile provides to you.</p>

		<h3>New Services and New Terms</h3>
		<p>Whenever new products or services are introduced on the Website as part of the Services, your use of such Services will be subject to these Website Terms and Conditions of Use unless TMX Newsfile notifies you otherwise. TMX Newsfile reserves the right to change the Website Terms and Conditions of Use at any time. Access or use after such changes indicates your acceptance of the modified Website Terms and Conditions of Use. You agree to review the Website Terms and Conditions of Use regularly.</p>

		<h3>Website Modification</h3>
		<p>TMX Newsfile may, at any time and in its sole discretion, change the Website, including eliminating or discontinuing any Web Content or Services on or made available through the Website.</p>

		<h3>DISCLAIMER</h3>
		<p>THE WEB CONTENT ON OR MADE AVAILABLE THROUGH THE WEBSITE IS FOR INFORMATIONAL PURPOSES ONLY AND IS NOT INTENDED TO PROVIDE LEGAL, ACCOUNTING, TAX, INVESTMENT, FINANCIAL OR OTHER ADVICE AND SUCH CONTENT SHOULD NOT BE RELIED UPON FOR SUCH ADVICE. YOU SHOULD SEEK PROFESSIONAL ADVICE, OPINIONS AND RECOMMENDATIONS BEFORE ACTING OR OMITTING TO ACT BASED ON ANY CONTENT FOUND ON OR THROUGH THIS WEBSITE. WE AND EACH OF OUR AFFILIATES, DIRECTORS, OFFICERS, AGENTS, REPRESENTATIVES AND SERVICE PROVIDERS ASSUME NO LIABILITY FOR ANY INACCURATE, DELAYED, OR INCOMPLETE WEB CONTENT, NOR FOR ANY ACTIONS TAKEN IN RELIANCE THEREON. THE WEB CONTENT CONTAINED ON OR MADE AVAILABLE THROUGH THE WEBSITE, ABOUT INDIVIDUALS AND ENTITIES, HAS BEEN SUPPLIED BY SUCH INDIVIDUALS OR ENTITIES WITHOUT VERIFICATION BY US. THE VIEWS, OPINIONS AND ADVICE OF ANY THIRD PARTY PROVIDED ON THE WEBSITE REFLECT THOSE OF THE INDIVIDUAL AUTHORS AND ARE NOT ENDORSED BY US.  WE ARE NOT RESPONSIBLE FOR THE ACCURACY OR RELIABILITY OF ANY INFORMATION, DATA, OPINIONS, ADVICE, OR STATEMENTS MADE BY SUCH INDIVIDUALS OR ENTITIES. NEITHER WE, NOR ANY OF OUR AFFILIATES OR SERVICE PROVIDERS MAKES OR HAS MADE ANY RECOMMENDATIONS REGARDING THE PRODUCTS, FEATURES OR SERVICES (INCLUDING SECURITIES OR INVESTMENT SERVICES) OF ANY PERSON OR ENTITY WITH RESPECT TO THE WEB CONTENT OF THIS WEBSITE, OR OF THE ADVISABILITY OF PROCURING ANY PRODUCTS OR SERVICES (INCLUDING INVESTING IN SECURITIES GENERALLY) FOR ANY PARTICULAR INDIVIDUAL OR ENTITY.</p>
		<p>THIS WEBSITE AND THE WEB CONTENT COULD INCLUDE TECHNICAL OR OTHER INACCURACIES OR TYPOGRAPHICAL ERRORS, AND THE WEBSITE AND WEB CONTENT  ARE PROVIDED TO YOU ON AN "AS IS" BASIS WITHOUT WARRANTIES OR REPRESENTATIONS OF ANY KIND. WE AND OUR AFFILIATES AND SERVICE PROVIDERS MAKE NO REPRESENTATIONS AND DISCLAIM ALL EXPRESS AND IMPLIED WARRANTIES AND CONDITIONS OF ANY KIND, INCLUDING, WITHOUT LIMITATION, REPRESENTATIONS, WARRANTIES OR CONDITIONS REGARDING ACCURACY, TIMELINESS, COMPLETENESS, NON-INFRINGEMENT, SATISFACTORY QUALITY, MERCHANTABILITY, MERCHANTABLE QUALITY OR FITNESS FOR ANY PARTICULAR PURPOSE OR THOSE ARISING BY LAW, STATUTE, USAGE OF TRADE, OR COURSE OF DEALING. WE AND OUR AFFILIATES AND SERVICE PROVIDERS ASSUME NO RESPONSIBILITY TO YOU OR ANY THIRD PARTY FOR THE CONSEQUENCES OF ANY ERRORS OR OMISSIONS.</p>

		<h3>LIMITATION OF LIABILITY</h3>
		<p>Neither we nor our affiliates, Service Providers and their respective directors, officers, employees, or agents will, under any circumstances, be liable for any direct, consequential, incidental, indirect or special damages, or any other damages whatsoever, of any kind, including without limitation damages arising from: (a) any decision made or action taken by you in reliance upon the Website or Web Content; (b) your loss of use, data or profits, whether resulting from your use of or inability to use the Website or Web Content on or made available through this Website (or a website linked to this Website); or (c) any other cause, even if such damages are caused by us, our affiliates or Service Provider’s negligence, and even if we, our affiliates or Service Providers, have been apprised that the damages were likely to occur.</p>
		<p>Neither we nor any of our affiliates, Service Providers and their officers, directors, employees or agents: (a) has reviewed or verified the merit of any of the securities referred to on this Website, the websites of any linked site, or any of the products, features or services offered by any third party; or (b) has endorsed or sponsored any of the securities or any of the products, features or services offered by any third party; (c) makes or has made any recommendation regarding: (i)  any securities issued by any of the companies identified on or linked to this Website, (ii) the advisability of investing in securities generally for any particular individual, or (iii) any of the products, features or services offered by any third party. PLEASE SEEK THE ADVICE OF PROFESSIONALS, AS APPROPRIATE, REGARDING THE EVALUATION OF ANY SPECIFIC SECURITY, INDEX, REPORT, PRODUCT, OPINION, ADVICE OR OTHER WEB CONTENT. Neither we nor any of our affiliates, Service Providers and their respective officers, directors, employees or agents are providing any technical, business, legal, or financial advice whatsoever.</p>
